="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> tackle new, </span><span style="margin: 0px">challenging</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">questions</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><ol role="list" start="2" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">Responsibility</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Ownership</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Collective</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">responsibility</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">ownership</span><span style="margin: 0px"> drive </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="marg